#: data/maps/Route104/scripts.inc:997
msgctxt "Route104_Text_BrineyLivesInSeasideCottage"
msgid ""
"That seaside cottage is where\n"
"MR. BRINEY lives.\p"
"He was once a mighty sailor who never\n"
"feared the sea, however stormy.$"
msgstr ""
"那座海边的小屋\n"
"是哈奇老人的家。\p"
"他以前是一位了不起的水手，\n"
"不管风浪多大都不怕。$"

#: data/maps/Route104/scripts.inc:1003
msgctxt "Route104_Text_WhatsItLikeAtBottomOfSea"
msgid ""
"The sea, huh?\p"
"I wonder what it's like at the bottom\n"
"of the sea?$"
msgstr ""
"大海啊……\p"
"不知道海底\n"
"是什么样子的呢？$"

#: data/maps/Route104/scripts.inc:1008
msgctxt "Route104_Text_ThrowBallAtWeakenedPokemon"
msgid ""
"If you're going to throw a POKé BALL,\n"
"weaken the wild POKéMON first.\p"
"It will be easier to catch if it's been\n"
"poisoned, burned, or lulled to sleep.$"
msgstr ""
"要扔精灵球的话，\n"
"就先把野生宝可梦削弱吧。\p"
"如果它中毒、灼伤或者睡着了，\n"
"就会更容易捉到。$"

#: data/maps/Route104/scripts.inc:1014
msgctxt "Route104_Text_OnlyThrowBallAtWildPokemon"
msgid ""
"You're a thief if you try to steal\n"
"someone else's POKéMON.\p"
"You should throw POKé BALLS only at\n"
"wild POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"想抢别人的宝可梦，\n"
"那可是小偷的行为。\p"
"精灵球只能对野生宝可梦扔哦。$"

#: data/maps/Route104/scripts.inc:1020
msgctxt "Route104_Text_ImNotATrainer"
msgid ""
"Oh, no, I'm not a TRAINER.\p"
"But that's right, if TRAINERS lock eyes,\n"
"it's a challenge to battle.\p"
"If you don't want to battle, stay out\n"
"of their sight.$"
msgstr ""
"哦，不不，我不是训练家。\p"
"不过你说得没错，训练家之间\n"
"只要视线相交，就是要对战的信号。\p"
"如果你不想对战，\n"
"就别走进他们的视线里。$"

#: data/maps/Route104/scripts.inc:1027
msgctxt "Route104_Text_LikeFillingMouthWithSeedsTakeThis"
msgid ""
"I like filling my mouth with seeds,\n"
"then spitting them out fast!\p"
"You can have this, so you try it out!\p"
"Use it on a POKéMON, and it will learn\n"
"a move for firing seeds rapidly.$"
msgstr ""
"我喜欢在嘴里塞满种子，\n"
"然后飞快地把它们吐出去！\p"
"这个给你，你也试试吧！\p"
"对宝可梦使用它，\n"
"就能学会快速发射种子的招式。$"

#: data/maps/Route104/scripts.inc:1034
msgctxt "Route104_Text_TMsAreOneTimeUse"
msgid ""
"A word of advice!\p"
"A TM, TECHNICAL MACHINE, is good only\n"
"for one-time use.\p"
"Once you use it, it's gone.\n"
"Think twice before using it!$"
msgstr ""
"给你一个忠告！\p"
"招式学习器只能使用一次。\p"
"用过一次就没有了。\n"
"使用前要好好考虑哦！$"

#: data/maps/Route104/scripts.inc:1041
msgctxt "Route104_Text_DontNeedThisTakeIt"
msgid ""
"This FLOWER SHOP started selling\n"
"saplings recently.\p"
"It made me so happy, I went overboard\n"
"shopping.\p"
"I don't need this WHITE HERB anymore.\n"
"Would you take it, please?$"
msgstr ""
"这家花店最近开始卖树苗了。\p"
"我太开心了，\n"
"结果一不小心买了太多。\p"
"这个白色香草我已经用不上了。\n"
"你愿意收下吗？$"

#: data/maps/Route104/scripts.inc:1049
msgctxt "Route104_Text_FlowerShopSellingSaplings"
msgid ""
"This FLOWER SHOP started selling\n"
"saplings recently.\p"
"It made me so happy, I went overboard\n"
"shopping. Where should I put them?$"
msgstr ""
"这家花店最近开始卖树苗了。\p"
"我太开心了，结果一不小心\n"
"买了太多。该放在哪里好呢？$"

#: data/maps/Route104/scripts.inc:1055
msgctxt "Route104_Text_MrBrineysCottage"
msgid "MR. BRINEY'S COTTAGE$"
msgstr "哈奇老人的小屋$"

#: data/maps/Route104/scripts.inc:1058
msgctxt "Route104_Text_RouteSignPetalburg"
msgid ""
"ROUTE 1O4\n"
"{RIGHT_ARROW} PETALBURG CITY$"
msgstr ""
"104号道路\n"
"{RIGHT_ARROW} 橙华市$"

#: data/maps/Route104/scripts.inc:1062
msgctxt "Route104_Text_RouteSignRustboro"
msgid ""
"ROUTE 1O4\n"
"{UP_ARROW} RUSTBORO CITY$"
msgstr ""
"104号道路\n"
"{UP_ARROW} 卡那兹市$"

#: data/maps/Route104/scripts.inc:1066
msgctxt "Route104_Text_PrettyPetalFlowShop"
msgid "PRETTY PETAL FLOWER SHOP$"
msgstr "美丽花瓣花店$"

#: data/maps/Route104/scripts.inc:1069
msgctxt "Route104_Text_TrainerTipsDoubleBattles"
msgid ""
"TRAINER TIPS\p"
"In the HOENN region there are pairs\n"
"of TRAINERS who challenge others\l"
"for 2-on-2 POKéMON battles called\l"
"DOUBLE BATTLES.\p"
"In a DOUBLE BATTLE, the TRAINER must\n"
"send out two POKéMON, the one at the\l"
"left of the list and the top one.\l"
"Watch how POKéMON are lined up.$"
msgstr ""
"训练家小贴士\p"
"在丰缘地区，有些训练家会两人\n"
"一组，向别人发起2对2的\l"
"宝可梦对战，这叫作双打对战。\p"
"在双打对战中，训练家必须派出\n"
"2只宝可梦，也就是队伍里\l"
"最前面的2只。\l"
"要注意宝可梦的排列顺序哦。$"

#: data/maps/Route104/scripts.inc:1080
msgctxt "Route104_Text_MayWeShouldRegister"
msgid ""
"MAY: Oh, hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
"DEVON upgraded your POKéNAV with\n"
"the MATCH CALL system, huh?\p"
"We should register each other so we\n"
"can get in contact anytime.$"
msgstr ""
"小遥：哦，你好，{PLAYER}{KUN}！\p"
"得文公司帮你的宝可导航\n"
"装上了对战呼叫系统吧？\p"
"我们互相登记一下吧，\n"
"这样随时都能联系了。$"

#: data/maps/Route104/scripts.inc:1087
msgctxt "Route104_Text_RegisteredMay"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} registered MAY\n"
"in the POKéNAV.$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}在宝可导航中\n"
"登记了小遥。$"

#: data/maps/Route104/scripts.inc:1091
msgctxt "Route104_Text_MayHowsYourPokedex"
msgid ""
"MAY: Oh, by the way, {PLAYER}{KUN},\n"
"how's your POKéDEX coming along?$"
msgstr ""
"小遥：对了，{PLAYER}{KUN}，\n"
"你的宝可梦图鉴进展得怎么样了？$"

#: data/maps/Route104/scripts.inc:1095
msgctxt "Route104_Text_MayMinesDecentLetsBattle"
msgid ""
"Mine's looking pretty decent.\n"
"So…\l"
"How about a little battle?$"
msgstr ""
"我的已经挺不错了哦。\n"
"所以……\l"
"我们来小小地对战一场怎么样？$"

#: data/maps/Route104/scripts.inc:1100
msgctxt "Route104_Text_MayHaventRaisedPokemon"
msgid ""
"MAY: Oh, what's the matter?\p"
"Haven't you caught or raised your\n"
"POKéMON very much?\p"
"That's not very good for a TRAINER!$"
msgstr ""
"小遥：咦，怎么了？\p"
"你还没怎么捉宝可梦，\n"
"也没怎么培养它们吗？\p"
"作为训练家，这样可不太好哦！$"

#: data/maps/Route104/scripts.inc:1106
msgctxt "Route104_Text_MayLetsBattle"
msgid ""
"MAY: So, what do you think?\n"
"How about a little battle here?$"
msgstr ""
"小遥：怎么样？\n"
"我们在这里小小地对战一场吧？$"

#: data/maps/Route104/scripts.inc:1110
msgctxt "Route104_Text_MayIntro"
msgid ""
"MAY: You just became a TRAINER,\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}. I'm not going to lose!$"
msgstr ""
"小遥：{PLAYER}{KUN}，你才刚成为\n"
"训练家。我是不会输的！$"

#: data/maps/Route104/scripts.inc:1114
msgctxt "Route104_Text_MayDefeat"
msgid ""
"Yikes!\n"
"You're better than I expected!$"
msgstr ""
"哎呀！\n"
"你比我想象的还要厉害！$"

#: data/maps/Route104/scripts.inc:1118
msgctxt "Route104_Text_MayPostBattle"
msgid ""
"MAY: I can tell you've gotten pretty\n"
"good with the way you handle POKéMON.\p"
"But instead of only making them\n"
"battle, you should be like MR. BRINEY.\p"
"It's important to become friends with\n"
"POKéMON, too.$"
msgstr ""
"小遥：看你使唤宝可梦的样子，\n"
"就知道你进步了不少。\p"
"不过，不要只是让它们对战，\n"
"你应该向哈奇老人学习。\p"
"和宝可梦成为朋友\n"
"也是很重要的哦。$"

#: data/maps/Route104/scripts.inc:1126
msgctxt "Route104_Text_BrendanWeShouldRegister"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: Oh, hey, {PLAYER}!\p"
"Cool, you had DEVON install the MATCH\n"
"CALL system on your POKéNAV!\p"
"Let's register each other in our\n"
"POKéNAVS so we can keep in touch.$"
msgstr ""
"小悠：哦，嘿，{PLAYER}！\p"
"真酷，你让得文公司在宝可导航上\n"
"装了对战呼叫系统啊！\p"
"我们在宝可导航里互相登记吧，\n"
"这样就能保持联系了。$"

#: data/maps/Route104/scripts.inc:1133
msgctxt "Route104_Text_RegisteredBrendan"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} registered BRENDAN\n"
"in the POKéNAV.$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}在宝可导航中\n"
"登记了小悠。$"

#: data/maps/Route104/scripts.inc:1137
msgctxt "Route104_Text_BrendanHowsYourPokedex"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: {PLAYER}, how's your POKéDEX?\n"
"Have you filled in any pages yet?$"
msgstr ""
"小悠：{PLAYER}，你的图鉴怎么样了？\n"
"已经填了几页了吗？$"

#: data/maps/Route104/scripts.inc:1141
msgctxt "Route104_Text_BrendanDoingGreatLetsBattle"
msgid ""
"Me, I'm doing great!\p"
"Want to check out how good I am with\n"
"a battle?$"
msgstr ""
"我啊，我可是很顺利哦！\p"
"要不要通过对战\n"
"看看我有多厉害？$"

#: data/maps/Route104/scripts.inc:1146
msgctxt "Route104_Text_BrendanNoConfidence"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: What's the matter? Don't have\n"
"any confidence in your POKéMON?$"
msgstr ""
"小悠：怎么了？\n"
"你对你的宝可梦没有信心吗？$"

#: data/maps/Route104/scripts.inc:1150
msgctxt "Route104_Text_BrendanLetsBattle"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: What's up?\n"
"Want to have a battle with me?$"
msgstr ""
"小悠：怎么样？\n"
"要跟我对战吗？$"

#: data/maps/Route104/scripts.inc:1154
msgctxt "Route104_Text_BrendanIntro"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: I know you just became\n"
"a TRAINER, but I won't go easy!$"
msgstr ""
"小悠：我知道你才刚成为训练家，\n"
"不过我可不会手下留情！$"

#: data/maps/Route104/scripts.inc:1158
msgctxt "Route104_Text_BrendanDefeat"
msgid ""
"Hmm…\n"
"You're pretty good.$"
msgstr ""
"嗯……\n"
"你还挺厉害的嘛。$"

#: data/maps/Route104/scripts.inc:1162
msgctxt "Route104_Text_BrendanPostBattle"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: You've gotten pretty decent\n"
"at handling POKéMON.\p"
"But, you know, you shouldn't just be\n"
"making POKéMON battle.\p"
"Like MR. BRINEY, it's important to\n"
"become friends with your POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"小悠：你使唤宝可梦已经\n"
"挺有一套了。\p"
"不过啊，你不应该\n"
"只是让宝可梦对战。\p"
"要像哈奇老人那样，\n"
"和宝可梦成为朋友也很重要。$"
